{"id": "clm:5d06e59e2468de43d724b2c6ccda414a88023f3d990d301291714e88789cdd53", "type": "statement", "text": "Avro record schema resolution matches fields by name; when a reader expects a field absent from the writer schema it uses the reader default, or signals an error if there is no default. Salesforce’s old-schema compatibility is conditional on these resolution rules. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://avro.apache.org/docs/1.12.0/specification/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/getschema-rpc.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:bcf151aa439ba4c3d4766ac0c2813f46900ebda172f47da4312fa9e25000872f", "ev:e1500cfa9220c42c08aee15d57ff2874d532639ac3df3a460eb7c733c7083195"]}
{"id": "clm:ef64eb7c047141f7e32e60b2dd144b06ebe9ce9af18b2c4e971440a9de75e01f", "type": "statement", "text": "Cache schemas instead of calling GetSchema for every RPC; retrieve a new schema when the received schema ID changes after a definition change. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/getschema-rpc.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:4da90574e9bed12b63ed685b7d950c5f0ffec648da2ddbb410cb92c1e2148926"]}
{"id": "clm:d91a166c11f43ce0711a0e4f1fae10f865f91fe3d042c0f9392f007efbbb2996", "type": "statement", "text": "Pub/Sub CDC delivers raw Avro payloads; decode the change-header bitmaps against the event schema before using their field names. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/event-deserialization-considerations.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://github.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/blob/main/python/util/ChangeEventHeaderUtility.py"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:52efcd8e655d59b3b846eaabf77541022d9e127f6a47845b88b8d6381fe362b2", "ev:eb8df8e04c3d05d9cb6b979e312b78dd3e539ffe0ced5412d85bbf6b25649c2b"]}
{"id": "clm:a06d738e3b35a3ab29d797b132d33467c0e6d87ca41bdb92da4152dbcf226627", "type": "statement", "text": "For a received event, get the schema ID from the event message in FetchResponse, retrieve that schema with GetSchema, and use it to deserialize the payload. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/getschema-rpc.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:a5e6a44e4a97022e6c02477e88e6550c37069199cb63fd0e76b2cdfba4c9aede"]}
{"id": "clm:bdb8ee39b149aef4e8f611165718c12d371179bf1773b4207dd07b9307b51b93", "type": "statement", "text": "An empty value in an UPDATE payload does not prove a field was cleared: unchanged fields also carry empty values. Decode changedFields and nulledFields to distinguish these cases. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/event-deserialization-considerations.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-event-fields-body.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9e7620e4ccd1308cbeeb9be4ab1b4eef7675bfc4810286bcdfa6985e99c214e7", "ev:a9d8551392cbed2464a331c4697c1768c63f98e1c0cc319ea233b025ccc21d38"]}
{"id": "clm:275963130aef0efab0b22bad72b6fe82afd389372aecde7e701697b628ef20f5", "type": "statement", "text": "changedFields includes fields explicitly set to null; nulledFields isolates fields cleared to null. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-event-fields-body.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/event-deserialization-considerations.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:497fad53a425e904f75b590f34d4be65fe255537de12d2cba84bb4559aea0468", "ev:75d692a8c1715845640555209dcb91af5f36a506c07523f93420452b9a911711"]}
{"id": "clm:592a46ea9d341af7a8dcbec320aaaef0e577f5fa06a2da9f3996bd02608b8015", "type": "statement", "text": "changedFields describes updates and is empty for other operations, including creation; a CREATE body still includes all record and system fields, even empty ones. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-event-fields-header.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-event-fields-body.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8b2537eb1ab6ccc65522041b59ac37e19e178cfe2bddb6a8ff6fa7661b534b7a", "ev:d5f232ce280a02a418a38f89fc343a8fb477aa18734603739ae9799c4fcd6fed"]}
{"id": "clm:148591978aa3d16b856a29107d1a1229f102e491576d29ecbafb169556ea2f4f", "type": "statement", "text": "diffFields identifies values delivered as a diff; the CDC header reference specifies a unified diff for large text values, so these payload values need diff interpretation. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/event-deserialization-considerations.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-event-fields-header.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:7b6bc9d0a2079a20a409158c5264fd15b1d12669551bf719ee202e753b4f72ca", "ev:c881c89fe86e8002da40e2bb4cfb3f1d5d72668341a80121fdbb82a007fe6349"]}
{"id": "clm:e056c7917201ac783205aed41c75c5b2a86413bb5974bfde2a90fe421fa91b2e", "type": "statement", "text": "The Python sample resolves compound-field bitmap entries by splitting the parent position from the child bitmap, selecting that parent’s nested schema, and returning dotted parent and child field names. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://github.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/blob/main/python/util/ChangeEventHeaderUtility.py", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:56758773446746fd583f0c9df42e3655a2ae42e0ea300be2bd2f2843afb196e5", "ev:c680b7dfdbdb010ae498d0129a5a7c41b13ef0d5fd616b7273650bee76a65c08"]}
{"id": "clm:219024c0ac4908d339e686484754e8435f478305c47591cb5ff995f004b09396", "type": "statement", "text": "Field presence alone does not prove a change: Salesforce’s enriched-event example includes values for unchanged enriched fields; changedFields identifies the actual changes. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-enrich-event-example.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce CDC Avro schemas and changed-field interpretation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:de7f79b5cff35f611b3804132c5fd239b280c80bffe9928d4b889593a25576a2", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c922c602ea30b4c7a03b78c7304811dd0c78a4047b8ab3a1f529eb2448e07f35"]}
